          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆಚರಿಸು (ācarisu) is Sanskrit ācaraṇa, \"practice, observance\", made into a Kannada verb with -isu: to celebrate a festival is to observe it."
            }
          ]
        },
